# device-layer-0006.
# Vibration and haptics: a tap or a pattern the person feels, through the feedback generators on iOS,
# NSHapticFeedbackManager on macOS (a Force Touch trackpad), VibrationEffect on Android, navigator.vibrate in a
# browser.
#
#   vibrate(kind)   kind is light, medium, heavy, success, warning or error. Answers `played`, or `unavailable`
#                   with nothing to play it on
#
# A host with no such capability (the server, the memory host) answers `unavailable`. Every answer is text from the
# closed set above, so an app compares strings and no platform enum ever reaches it.

load ./native/{platform}/vibration
  find play-vibration

task vibrate
  take kind, like text
  like text
  send back
    call play-vibration
      read kind
